`build_goal_for_chief_manager()` returns a dict compatible with `graph.Goal` from chief-manager:

```python
{
    "statement": str,
    "success_criteria": [str, ...],
    "deliverable_format": str,
    "out_of_scope": [str, ...],
    "constraints": [str, ...],
    "subgoals": [],  # comes later from chief-manager Phase 1
    "_clarification_metadata": {
        "confidence": float,
        "stability_score": float,
        "iterations": int,
        "active_persona": str,
        "open_contradictions": [...],
    }
